@startuml
title UC-08 - Terraform v2 provisioning (ADR-014)
autonumber
actor "UC-06 / UC-07" as Caller
control ResourceProvisioningService as Service
control OutputBindingResolver as Bindings
control ModulePreflight as Modules
boundary TerraformExecutor as Terraform
control ConnectionCredentialResolver as Credentials
boundary TerraformStateBackend as State
database "Encrypted state / locks" as DB
database "ResourceInstance / Attempt" as Intent
control OutputContractValidator as Validator
boundary SecretStore as Secrets
database "ActiveResource / DeploymentResource" as Results
Caller -> Service: Provision(pinned plan, Environment owner/fence)
loop Provider-first nodes
  Service -> Intent: Resolve stable instance; persist action/ownership/physical intent
  Service -> Bindings: Resolve params / completed outputs / provider target
  Service -> Modules: Verify pinned digest and contract; no mutable upgrade
  Modules --> Service: verified module + inputs
  Service -> Credentials: Resolve scoped Environment AWS / Kubernetes / EKS target
  Credentials --> Service: private invocation credential
  Service -> Terraform: CREATE or non-destructive UPDATE(instance, module, state ref)
  Terraform -> State: LOCK(state ID, invocation capability, lock ID)
  State -> DB: Claim lock with current Environment owner/fence
  DB --> State: locked or conflict
  State --> Terraform: 200 or 409/423
  Terraform -> State: GET restricted state
  State -> DB: Read ciphertext
  State --> Terraform: decrypted state (private)
  Terraform -> Terraform: init/validate/plan; reject UPDATE delete/replace
  Terraform -> Terraform: apply saved plan within deadline
  Terraform -> State: POST(state, lock ID)
  State -> DB: Validate owner/fence/lineage/serial; encrypt + atomic write
  DB --> State: acknowledged
  State --> Terraform: acknowledgement
  Terraform -> State: UNLOCK matching owner/fence/lock ID
  State -> DB: Release only current lock
  Terraform --> Service: outputs + observed IDs / safe failure
  alt successful resource and state acknowledgement
    Service -> Validator: Validate Type outputs and readiness
    Service -> Secrets: Store secret outputs; reuse stable credential refs
    Secrets --> Service: typed opaque refs
    Service -> Results: Commit READY + safe outputs/progress (short transaction)
  else failure / uncertain result
    Service -> Intent: Persist stage/status; keep state and private recovery handle
    note over Service, Terraform
    Known transient: at most one bounded retry after state/result checks.
    Unknown outcome: hold, no CREATE replay or automatic resume/import.
    Failure stops dependent batches; only safe independent cleanup continues.
    Failure does not authorize dependency destruction.
    end note
  end
end
Service --> Caller: typed outputs + scoped target / safe failed node
note over Caller, Service
score-k8s runs only in UC-06 after outputs.
Existing k8s-4f cluster is resolved, never created/destroyed.
end note
@enduml
